{"id": "15-1709-2-9", "zh": "主格：Daḷhadhammā、daḷhadhammo、daḷhadhammāno、daḷhadhammā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1709-10-17", "zh": "宾格：Daḷhadhammānaṃ、daḷhadhammaṃ、daḷhadhammāne、daḷhadhamme。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1709-18-25", "zh": "具格：Daḷhadhamminā、daḷhadhammena、daḷhadhammehi、daḷhadhammebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1709-26-29", "zh": "与格：Daḷhadhammassa、daḷhadhammānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1709-30-41", "zh": "从格：Daḷadhamminā、daḷhadhammā、daḷhadhammasmā、daḷhadhammamhā、daḷhadhammehi、daḷhadhammebhi。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1709-42-45", "zh": "属格：Daḷhadhammassa、daḷhadhammānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1709-46-53", "zh": "处格：Daḷhadhamme、daḷhadhammasmiṃ、daḷhadhammamhi、daḷhadhammesu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1709-54-62", "zh": "呼格：bho daḷhadhamma、bhavanto daḷhadhammāno、bhavanto daḷhadhammā。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1709-63-70", "zh": "同样，paccakkhadhammā、paccakkhadhammo 的混合词形变化表也应照此配列。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-1710-2-7", "zh": "现在说 vivaṭacchada 一词的名词词形变化表：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-1711-2-7", "zh": "主格：Vivaṭacchadā、vivaṭacchadā、vivaṭacchadāno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1711-8-11", "zh": "宾格：Vivaṭacchadānaṃ、vivaṭacchadāne。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1711-12-17", "zh": "具格：Vivaṭacchadena、vivaṭacchadehi、vivaṭacchadebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1711-18-21", "zh": "与格：Vivaṭacchadassa、vivaṭacchadānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1711-22-27", "zh": "从格：Vivaṭacchadā、vivaṭacchadehi、vivaṭacchadebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1711-28-31", "zh": "属格：Vivaṭacchadassa、vivaṭacchadānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1711-32-35", "zh": "处格：Vivaṭacchade、vivaṭacchadesu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1711-36-44", "zh": "呼格：bho vivaṭacchada、bhavanto vivaṭacchadā、bhavanto vivaṭacchadāno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1712-2-24", "zh": "这个名词词形变化表，是因为见到“如果他离家出家，就会成为阿罗汉、正等正觉者，在世间揭开覆障者（vivaṭacchadā）”这句圣典文，才按 ā 结尾的方式来说的。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1712-25-49", "zh": "但因为也见到“在世间揭开覆障者（vivaṭacchado）”这样的圣典文，所以也应按 o 结尾的方式来说：“vivaṭacchado、vivaṭacchadā、vivaṭacchadaṃ、vivaṭacchade”。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1712-50-61", "zh": "也应按混合的方式来说：“vivaṭacchadā、vivaṭacchado、vivaṭacchadāno、vivaṭacchadā。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1712-62-72", "zh": "vivaṭacchadānaṃ、vivaṭacchadaṃ、vivaṭacchadāne、vivaṭacchade”。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1713-2-11", "zh": "现在说 vattaha 一词的名词词形变化表：**vattahā** 指的是帝释。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1714-2-5", "zh": "主格：Vattahā、vattahāno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1714-6-9", "zh": "宾格：Vattahānaṃ、vattahāne。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1714-10-15", "zh": "具格：Vattahānā、vattahānehi、vattahānebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1714-16-19", "zh": "与格：Vattahino、vattahānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1714-20-25", "zh": "从格：Vattahānā、vattahānehi、vattahānebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1714-26-29", "zh": "属格：Vattahino、vattahānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1714-30-33", "zh": "处格：Vattahāne、vattahānesu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1714-34-39", "zh": "呼格：bho vattaha、bhavanto vattahāno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1714-40-52", "zh": "或者也可以作“bho vattahā、bho vattahāno”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1715-2-7", "zh": "现在说 vuttasira 一词的名词词形变化表：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-1716-2-7", "zh": "主格：Vuttasirā、vuttasirā、vuttasirāno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1716-8-11", "zh": "宾格：Vuttasirānaṃ、vuttasirāne。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1716-12-17", "zh": "具格：Vuttasirānā、vuttasirānehi、vuttasirānebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1716-18-27", "zh": "与格：Vuttasirassa、vuttasirānaṃ；从格：vuttasirā、vuttasirehi、vuttasirebhi。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "15-1716-28-31", "zh": "属格：Vuttasirassa、vuttasirānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1716-32-35", "zh": "处格：Vuttasire、vuttasiresu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1716-36-41", "zh": "呼格：bho vuttasira、bhānto vuttasirāno。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-1716-42-51", "zh": "也可以见到 o 结尾的读法“vuttasiro”。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "15-1717-2-7", "zh": "现在说 yuva 一词的名词词形变化表：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-1718-2-9", "zh": "主格：Yuvā、yuvā、yuvāno、yuvānā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1718-10-17", "zh": "宾格：Yuvānaṃ、yuvaṃ、yuvāne、yuve。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1718-18-31", "zh": "具格：Yuvānā、yuvena、yuvānena、yuvānehi、yuvānebhi、yuvehi、yuvebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1718-32-39", "zh": "与格：Yuvānassa、yuvassa、yuvānānaṃ、yuvānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1718-40-54", "zh": "从格：Yuvānā、yuvānasmā、yuvānamhā、yuvānehi、yuvānebhi、yuvehi、yuvebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1718-55-62", "zh": "属格：Yuvānassa、yuvassa、yuvānānaṃ、yuvānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1718-63-80", "zh": "处格：Yuvāne、yuvānasmiṃ、yuvānamhi、yuve、yuvasmiṃ、yuvamhi、yuvānesu、yuvāsu、yuvesu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1718-81-88", "zh": "呼格：bho yuva、yuvāna、bhavanto yuvānā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1719-2-19", "zh": "在这里可以看到三种方式：部分按 ā 结尾的方式、完全按 o 结尾的方式，以及部分按 o 结尾的方式。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "15-1720-2-21", "zh": "老师们对 maghava 一词，也像对 yuva 一词那样，以“maghavā、maghavā、maghavāno、maghavānā”等方式来配列名词词形变化表。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1720-22-31", "zh": "但在《尼鲁达藏》（Niruttipiṭaka）中则说：“maghavā 站着，maghavanto 站着。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-1720-32-37", "zh": "看见 maghavantaṃ，看见 maghavante。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1720-38-46", "zh": "由 maghavatā 所做，由 maghavantehi 所做，由 maghavantebhi 所做。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1720-47-52", "zh": "给予 maghavato，给予 maghavantānaṃ。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1720-53-61", "zh": "从 maghavatā 出离，从 maghavantehi 出离，从 maghavantebhi 出离。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-1720-62-67", "zh": "maghavato 的所有物，maghavantānaṃ 的所有物。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1720-68-73", "zh": "安住于 maghavati，安住于 maghavantesu。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1720-74-89", "zh": "bho maghavā、bhavanto maghavanto”——这是按照 guṇavā 一词的方式说的，《小尼鲁达》（Cūḷanirutti）中也是这样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-1720-90-94", "zh": "这与圣典相符、相合。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "15-1720-95-116", "zh": "因为圣典中说：“摩诃离，天帝释从前做人的时候，是一个名叫摩伽的青年，所以被称为 Maghavā。”", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "15-1720-117-143", "zh": "由此显示：“他有摩伽这个名字，所以是 maghavā”，也就是依表示“有”义的 vantu 词缀来成立这个词形；因此，它的名词词形变化表也应当像 guṇavantu 一词那样来配列。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-1721-2-20", "zh": "现在说 addha 一词的名词词形变化表：addha 一词用于时间和道路时，在“过去的时间（atīto addhā）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-1721-21-58", "zh": "漫长的道路难以走完”等句中，可以看到主格形“addhā”；它与“这句咒语确实难以理解”等句中表示“确定”义的不变词“addhā”同形。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-1721-59-67", "zh": "然而，不变词没有词形变化表，只有名词才有。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1722-2-7", "zh": "主格：Addhā、addhā、addhāno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1722-8-11", "zh": "宾格：Addhānaṃ、addhāne。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1722-12-17", "zh": "具格：Addhunā、addhānehi、addhānebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1722-18-21", "zh": "与格：Addhuno、addhānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1722-22-27", "zh": "从格：Addhunā、addhānehi、addhānebhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1722-28-31", "zh": "属格：Addhuno、addhānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1722-32-37", "zh": "处格：Addhani、addhāne、addhānesu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-1722-38-45", "zh": "呼格：bho addha、bhavanto addhā、addhāno。", "confidence": 80}
